---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Testimonials & Community Stories | Zip Solutions" 
  description="Hear directly from educators, faith communities, streamers, and individuals about the real-world impact of Zip Captions and Zip Solutions."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-alabaster to-slate-100 border-b border-slate-200/80 pt-16 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-brand font-heading mb-4">
        Verified Community Stories
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-midnight font-heading tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Real Voices. Real Impact.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Don’t just take our word for it. Discover how Zip Captions and our accessibility tools empower worship communities, classrooms, live streamers, and families around the world.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 sm:py-20 space-y-16">

    <!-- Featured Spotlight: Rock Valley First Reformed Church -->
    <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amethyst font-heading">
          Faith & Community Broadcast Spotlight
        </span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        <!-- Kevin Bouwman Column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <img 
              src="/images/Kevin_Circle.png" 
              alt="Kevin Bouwman" 
              class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl object-cover border-2 border-purple-100 shadow-sm"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-heading text-midnight">
                Kevin Bouwman
              </h2>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">
                Rock Valley First Reformed Church & Advisory Board Member
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-4 border-amethyst space-y-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-purple-200 mb-1 -ml-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              "Zip Captions makes it very easy to add live open captions to our service broadcasts for our livestream and our leased cable tv channel. We also incorporate live open captions on our in-person presentation screen."
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              "We have people with hearing loss who appreciate the captions and people without hearing loss who’ve said they find the captions helpful. The support team is very responsive when we needed help, and the development team has been very receptive to our feedback about how to improve and enhance the software."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
            <div class="p-3 bg-alabaster rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Distribution</span>
              <strong class="text-xs text-midnight font-bold">Cable TV & Stream</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-alabaster rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">In-Person</span>
              <strong class="text-xs text-midnight font-bold">Auditorium Screens</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-alabaster rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Audience</span>
              <strong class="text-xs text-midnight font-bold">Inclusive Worship</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Doris Quote Column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-purple-50/40 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-purple-100/80 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold font-heading text-amethyst uppercase tracking-wider">
                Congregation Voice
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-midnight text-base sm:text-lg font-medium italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "When sound is available but not understood, it’s as if you are listening to a foreign language. With this closed caption I can follow the service and hear The Message. What a wonderful experience!"
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-purple-200/60">
            <p class="font-bold text-sm text-midnight font-heading">Doris</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Congregation Member, Rock Valley First Reformed Church</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Assistive Tech & Education Section -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-midnight">
          Assistive Technology & Education Specialists
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 mt-1">
          How leading educators and assistive technology experts evaluate Zip Captions in academic and professional settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <!-- Brian Friedlander Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-brand font-heading block mb-1">
                Expert Review & Demonstration
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-midnight">
                Dr. Brian Friedlander
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">
                Assistive Technology Specialist & Associate Professor of Education
              </p>
            </div>
            <a 
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7298110392227016704" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-alabaster hover:bg-slate-200/80 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-midnight transition-colors"
            >
              <span>View on LinkedIn</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Responsive LinkedIn Embed -->
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 flex justify-center p-2">
            <iframe 
              src="https://www.linkedin.com/embed/feed/update/urn:li:share:7298110392227016704" 
              height="620" 
              width="504" 
              frameborder="0" 
              allowfullscreen="" 
              title="Dr. Brian Friedlander on LinkedIn"
              class="w-full max-w-full rounded-xl"
              loading="lazy"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hadley Media Showcase -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amethyst font-heading block mb-1">
              Production & Accessibility Feature
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-midnight mb-2">
              Hadley Media
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6">
              Showcasing practical accessibility workflows and real-time caption integration for modern media.
            </p>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 shadow-inner">
              <img 
                src="/images/hadley.png" 
                alt="Hadley Media Instagram Feature on Zip Captions" 
                class="w-full h-auto object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
            <span>Featured on Instagram</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-slate-700">Digital Accessibility Media</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Community & Creator Quotes Grid -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-midnight">
          Broadcasters, Creators & Streamers
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 mt-1">
          Simple real-time setup for OBS, live streams, and community events.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Chicago Knockouts / Necrohell -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold font-heading text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Live Stream Integration
              </span>
              <a 
                href="https://bsky.app" 
                target="_blank" 
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-midnight font-medium"
              >
                Bluesky
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="text-slate-800 text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
              "Recently discovered the wonderful Zip Captions app and how brilliantly easy it was to incorporate it into our <span class="text-teal-brand font-semibold">@chicagoknockouts</span> live stream."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-sm text-midnight font-heading">The Goat of Menendez</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">@necrohell.bsky.social</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Chicago Knockouts</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mia -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold font-heading text-amethyst uppercase tracking-wider">
                User Love
              </span>
              <a 
                href="https://bsky.app/profile/techmia.bsky.social" 
                target="_blank" 
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs text-amethyst hover:text-midnight font-medium"
              >
                @techmia.bsky.social
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="text-midnight text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-heading leading-snug">
              "I LOVE ZIP CAPTIONS. Full stop."
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Real-time, zero-friction live captioning right inside the browser that just works when you need it most.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-sm text-midnight font-heading">Mia</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Tech & Accessibility Enthusiast</p>
            </div>
            <a 
              href="https://bsky.app/profile/techmia.bsky.social" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-midnight font-mono"
            >
              techmia.bsky.social ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Share Your Story CTA -->
    <section class="bg-midnight rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-white text-center shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-brand font-heading block">
          Your Story Matters
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading">
          Using Zip Solutions in Your Organization?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Whether you’re an educator using EasySpeak, a house of worship running Zip Captions, or a broadcaster using Zip vMix, we’d love to hear how our tools are making a difference.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="/contact-us" 
            class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-heading font-bold text-sm text-midnight bg-white hover:bg-alabaster shadow-md transition-all"
          >
            Share Your Feedback
          </a>
          <a 
            href="/products" 
            class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-heading font-bold text-sm text-white border border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all"
          >
            Explore All Free Tools
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
